SaffronCity_HomeD_Text_Ask::
	.string "ROUTE TOURNAMENT. Beat one trainer\n"
	.string "on each of ten routes: R3, R4, R24,\p"
	.string "R25, R6, R11, R9, R10, R8, R12.\n"
	.string "Then face the ROUTE KING.$"

SaffronCity_HomeD_Text_Ready::
	.string "Ten routes, ten victories. The KING\n"
	.string "is waiting. Ready?$"

SaffronCity_HomeD_Text_Beaten::
	.string "The crown is yours... for now.$"

SaffronCity_HomeD_Text_Prize::
	.string "A new KING of the routes! Here,\n"
	.string "your prize.$"

SaffronCity_HomeD_Text_Done::
	.string "You are the ROUTE KING. The routes\n"
	.string "will remember.$"

SaffronCity_HomeD_Text_NoRoom::
	.string "Your BAG is full. Make room, then\n"
	.string "come back.$"
